My parents are talking.
I look at the laptop.
A person walks past in the background.
The picture is blurry.
I ask: "Who is that?"
My father laughs.
The person comes closer.
It is Diego.
He is my brother.
"Good morning, Maya!" he says.
"Good morning, Diego!" I reply.
He has a coffee in his hand.
Then I hear a voice.
"Is that Maya?" the voice asks.
A girl comes into the picture.
That is my sister, Sofia.
"Hello Maya!" she calls loudly.
"Hello Sofia!" I say and smile.
My family is together now.
